{"id":"e6cca9bbf44b6255","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-canonical-name.md","title":"ZFC Canonical Name","display":"df-zfc-canonical-name — ZFC Canonical Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-canonical-name","aliases":["58-df-zfc-canonical-name"],"display":"df-zfc-canonical-name — ZFC Canonical Name","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-canonical-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-canonical-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-canonical-name — ZFC Canonical Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x,x,P,R,1_P\\in V\">\\(\\dot x,x,P,R,1_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalNameStructure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalNameStructure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CanonicalNameStructure}_S(\\dot x,x,P,R,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land1_P\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_P\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\exists!F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\}),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;F(z)=\\{\\langle F(y),1_P\\rangle:y\\in z\\}\\land\\dot x=F(x)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CanonicalNameStructure}_S(\\dot x,x,P,R,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land1_P\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_P\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\exists!F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\}),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;F(z)=\\{\\langle F(y),1_P\\rangle:y\\in z\\}\\land\\dot x=F(x)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S(\\dot x,x,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CanonicalNameStructure}_S(\\dot x,x,P,R,1_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S(\\dot x,x,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CanonicalNameStructure}_S(\\dot x,x,P,R,1_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order relation and greatest condition are explicit in the structure predicate; the legacy three-argument form binds them existentially.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","em